SUMMARY:Exit Only: WEMBLEY CENTRAL STATION: Saturday 26 September\, between
  2140 and 2230\, the station will be busy due to the England vs Spain 
 match at Wembley Stadium. The main High Road entrance will be exit only 
 until the queue to enter the station clears. If you require step-free 
 access to the platforms\, please ask a member of staff. Main entry to the 
 station will be via the London Road events entrance which is not 
 step-free.
END:VEVENT
